# Service-Oriented Data Access

Follow the canonical rule defined in
`../haderach-platform/.cursor/rules/service-oriented-data-access.mdc`.

## Site-specific API split

- **Read content** via the Payload CMS REST API at `/cms/api/**`.
- **Write content / workflow / chat** via the agent service at
  `/agent/api/**`, so mutating operations stay behind RBAC, audit logging, and
  workflow validation.
